class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d29823616dbc5931\" href=\"?note=d29823616dbc5931\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P},\\kappa,\\alpha,\\beta\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> 是集合论语言，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma)\\)</span> 是显式语言中的可数传递模型谓词（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}}(v_0,v_1),\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}}(v_0),\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}}(v_0,v_1)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}}(v_0,v_1),\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}}(v_0),\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}}(v_0,v_1)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span> 分别编码“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1\">\\(v_1\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> 上的 c.c.c. 偏序”“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_0\">\\(v_0\\)</span> 是基数”和“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_1=\\operatorname{cf}(v_0)\">\\(v_1=\\operatorname{cf}(v_0)\\)</span>”；其自由变元依次包含于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_0\\}\">\\(\\{v_0\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{v_0,v_1\\}\">\\(\\{v_0,v_1\\}\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a>）。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\">\\((M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi[\\vec a]\\)</span> 表示上述公式码在传递集合结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(M,\\in)\">\\((M,\\in)\\)</span> 中、参数元组为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a\">\\(\\vec a\\)</span> 时的元理论真值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CheckName}_S\\)</span> 是规范检名关系，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 是带模型、条件、公式码、名字元组、载体和序关系的迫使关系（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"d29823616dbc5931\" href=\"?note=d29823616dbc5931\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"911508dbd8495663\" href=\"?note=911508dbd8495663\" title=\"./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md\">58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ccc-pres}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n&amp;\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}}[\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\Biggl[\n\\forall\\kappa\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}}[\\kappa]\n\\to\\exists\\check\\kappa,\\vec\\tau\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,1,M)\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\check\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{185pt}\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,p,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}},\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}}[\\alpha,\\beta]\n\\to\\exists\\check\\alpha,\\check\\beta,\\vec\\sigma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\beta,\\beta,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{185pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\sigma,2,M)\n\\land\\vec\\sigma(0)=\\check\\alpha\n\\land\\vec\\sigma(1)=\\check\\beta\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,p,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}},\\vec\\sigma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}ccc-pres}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n&amp;\\mathrm{CTMInLanguage}_S(M,\\mathcal L_\\in,\\Gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZFC}\\subseteq\\Gamma\n\\land\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}\\in M\n\\land(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\varphi_{\\mathrm{ccc}}[\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P}]\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\to\n\\Biggl[\n\\forall\\kappa\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}}[\\kappa]\n\\to\\exists\\check\\kappa,\\vec\\tau\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\kappa,\\kappa,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,1,M)\n\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\check\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{185pt}\\land\n\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,p,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{Card}},\\vec\\tau,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\n\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n(M,\\in)\\models_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}}[\\alpha,\\beta]\n\\to\\exists\\check\\alpha,\\check\\beta,\\vec\\sigma\\in M\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\alpha,\\alpha,\\mathbb P)\n\\land\\mathrm{CheckName}_S(\\check\\beta,\\beta,\\mathbb P)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{185pt}\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\sigma,2,M)\n\\land\\vec\\sigma(0)=\\check\\alpha\n\\land\\vec\\sigma(1)=\\check\\beta\n\\land\\forall p\\in\\mathbb P\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingRelation}_S\n(M,p,\\varphi_{\\mathrm{cf}},\\vec\\sigma,\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Biggr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>c.c.c. 必须由地模型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 内部判断；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 在外部可数，仅写外部的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\">\\(\\mathrm{CCC}(\\mathbb P,\\leq_{\\mathbb P})\\)</span> 不能推出保持结论。</li>\n<li>结论只量化 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 认为是基数或互为余终数的参数，并通过检名、名字元组和六元迫使关系表达保持性；不再把外部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 的基数与余终数误当成地模型对象。</li>\n<li>本结论仅记录基数与余终数保持；“增加新实数”需要另外的假设。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ccc.md","status":"resolved","id":"937fc0dd4cc72948","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ccc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"911508dbd8495663","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-zfc-forcing-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"d29823616dbc5931","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-check-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","